  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Gameplay_Tutorial_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6741925cc682c1845b875a8926a0c3bf, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 137478750208
    m_Localized: Good morning, Cora. Get ready for today's magic lesson.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 788086603776
    m_Localized: Good morning, sister! I'm ready!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 912351248384
    m_Localized: Good. Today's lesson is an important one. I'm going to teach you
      how to brew potions with healing properties.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 931456303104
    m_Localized: Like the ones you use on your patients?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 941979811840
    m_Localized: Exactly. You've made great progress in your studies, and the time
      has come for you to start helping me treat the villagers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 955246395392
    m_Localized: Imagine I was attacked by a magical creature and now have open wounds,
      feeling pain and nausea. Keep those in mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966231277568
    m_Localized: To brew a potion, you need ingredients. Head to the greenhouse and
      harvest every plant available. Then, meet me at the cauldron.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1255663419392
    m_Localized: Go gather the ingredients, then come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1568822738944
    m_Localized: Got everything? Excellent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1742471118848
    m_Localized: All living beings carry an amount of life energy within them. This
      energy can heal injuries, illnesses, and even certain curses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1747042910208
    m_Localized: When brewing a healing potion, we channel the life energy of plants.
      We always use 3 ingredients to reach the required amount of energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1770321297408
    m_Localized: Each plant has different medicinal properties. Knowing them is essential
      to brewing the right potion to help a patient. You can look them up anytime
      in the grimoire beside the cauldron.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1779129335808
    m_Localized: Remember the symptoms I mentioned earlier? Brew a potion capable
      of curing them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1787400503296
    m_Localized: This potion looks adequate. Head back to the counter to deliver
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2254234927104
    m_Localized: Excellent, Cora.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2604824215552
    m_Localized: Now, I will teach you another method for brewing potions. Meet me
      at the cauldron once more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2700471123968
    m_Localized: As I said, the life energy of living beings is what we use to heal.
      Plant energy works well, but it has its limits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3301439389696
    m_Localized: There is a spell that lets you channel your own life energy into
      the potion. Human energy is potent and versatile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3315586777088
    m_Localized: Using your life energy guarantees the potion heals the patient,
      regardless of the ingredients' efficacy. However, drawing on it means expending
      a bit of what keeps you alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3324281569280
    m_Localized: When you sleep, part of your life energy is restored.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3334691831808
    m_Localized: With time and practice, you will learn to manage your life energy
      more efficiently. For now, you can only use it once a day without harming yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3344393256960
    m_Localized: Well, let's begin. First, add 3 ingredients to the cauldron. Since
      we'll be using the spell, your choice of ingredients doesn't matter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3532356796416
    m_Localized: 'Great. Now, before finishing the potion, open the journal. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4038424739840
    m_Localized: "Oops\u2026 I think I mispronounced a word\u2026 Did I botch the
      spell?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4204728893440
    m_Localized: "Oh no\u2026 What have I done?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4303211151360
    m_Localized: I have to fix this. I need to find a way! And I still have to step
      up as the village healer in my sister's place and take care of everyone!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4447180636160
    m_Localized: Check the book so you don't mess this up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4790744465408
    m_Localized: My symptoms are open wounds, pain, and nausea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4951340171264
    m_Localized: Open the book to finish the potion!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12607442337792
    m_Localized: In addition to the ingredient details, the journal also contains
      instructions for casting the spell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12623082897408
    m_Localized: The rune is on the last page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
